WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.309
Getting to know a new support person can take more than one meeting.

2
00:00:04.309 --> 00:00:09.188
Meet in the place you agreed on. You can bring someone you trust if you want.

3
00:00:09.188 --> 00:00:12.989
Start with names and one simple question. Quiet is okay too.

4
00:00:12.989 --> 00:00:17.615
Share one thing that helps you, or show a note. You choose what to share.

5
00:00:17.615 --> 00:00:21.163
Ask anything you want to know about the plan or routine.

6
00:00:21.163 --> 00:00:24.775
You can ask for a break or more time to feel comfortable.

7
00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:29.760
You can share only what you want. Your comfort matters.
